  "Senza mappa all-sky, l’SQM è una stima dall’<a href=\"https://djlorenz.github.io/astronomy/lp/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">atlante di David Lorenz</a> (dati satellitari VIIRS 2025; incertezza tipica ±0,3 mag). Una misura con fotometro, se indicata, prevale.": "Without an all-sky map, the SQM is an estimate from <a href=\"https://djlorenz.github.io/astronomy/lp/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">David Lorenz’s atlas</a> (VIIRS 2025 satellite data; typical uncertainty ±0.3 mag). A photometer measurement, when indicated, takes precedence.",
