  "Hα molto intensa, OIII e SII deboli: da cieli luminosi basta già un filtro Hα o duo-band.": "Very strong Hα, weak OIII and SII: from bright skies an Hα or duo-band filter is already sufficient.",
  "Melotte 15 al centro e la Fish Head (IC 1795) sul bordo.": "Melotte 15 at the centre and the Fish Head (IC 1795) at the edge.",
